#sortorder:2
#showas:地盘争夺战
This challenging scenario has the Necromancer facing the Skirmisher AI (diff 8), along with the Templar (diff 8) and the Elderlings (diff 8). The AI is using Astro Trains to commission powerful projects if they are allowed to complete them. 

Some Neinzul have also been spotted. Migrant Fleets require an escort to safety and offer rewards for assistance. A splintered group of Neinzul Custodians has pulled us into their conflict, but we may have allies to support our fight. 
